    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your aberrant dragonmark gives you a natural affinity for vermin. When you use a spell that can target individual animals such as @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.wU6hNzK8Yfqdmc8m]{Possession} or @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.4YnON9JHYqtLzccu]{Summon Animal}, you may ignore the swarm mind immunity of swarms, and target swarms as an individual creature.</p>"
    },
